cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or code in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview v0.2: A 3B Chinese Narrative Model at the 2,000-Character Frontier"
version: 0.2
date-released: 2026-11-07
license: other
license-url: "https://github.com/ktznl01/Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ktznl01/Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview"
authors:
  - name: "Fluorestsentsiya-3B-Preview contributors"
keywords:
  - large language model
  - Chinese narrative generation
  - LoRA
  - Qwen2.5
  - GGUF
  - long-form generation
abstract: >-
  A rank-16 LoRA adapter on Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct for Chinese narrative writing
  in an old-translation register. v0.2 is evaluated on 21 held-out prompts with
  model-only outputs trimmed at 2,000 Chinese characters: mean 1,497.7 characters,
  11/21 at 2k, rep4 0.1827, duplicate-sentence rate 2.70%, distinct4 0.8173.
  The release is a 3B draft generator, not a human-level writer; distinct4
  improves by 9.0% over v0.1, below a literal +20% threshold.
